I go to the supermarket after work.
The supermarket is close to my flat.
I need ingredients for my dinner.
I walk through the aisles.
First, I buy vegetables.
I take tomatoes and a cucumber.
Then I look for pasta.
I also need apples.
I carry everything to the till.
The cashier greets me.
She says: "Hello, that comes to twelve Euro, please."
I pay by card.
She asks: "Do you need the receipt?"
I answer: "No, thank you."
Now I pack my groceries.
I put the food carefully into the shopping bag.
My laptop is in my backpack.
That way, the food stays safely separated.
I take my things.
Then I walk home.
